  "description": "Powerful 250W Motor for Everyday Commuting\nThe BK8SL is equipped with a 36V 250W brushless motor that easily handles slopes up to 25°. Choose from three pedal assist levels — 15km/h (9.3mph), 20km/h (12.4mph), and 25km/h (15.5mph) — to match your riding style. Whether you’re heading to work or enjoying a weekend ride, it delivers smooth and efficient power every time.\nLong-Range Removable Battery\nRide farther with the 36V 13Ah (468Wh) lithium battery, offering a range of 50–100 km (31–62 miles) on a single charge. The removable anti-theft design allows you to conveniently charge the battery at home or in the office, ensuring both safety and flexibility for daily use.\nSmart Bluetooth Display & APP Connectivity\nConnect your smartphone to the HITWAY APP via Bluetooth to track your speed, distance, power level, and riding route in real time. The clear, intuitive display keeps all key information visible at a glance — making every commute smarter and more connected.\n27.5” Anti-Puncture Tyres & Step-Through Frame\nThe 27.5×2.35-inch puncture-resistant tyres provide excellent grip and stability on urban roads. The step-through frame design makes mounting and dismounting effortless, perfect for riders of different heights and for those who value comfort and practicality during daily commutes.\nSafe, Convenient & TüV Certified\nDesigned with commuters in mind, the BK8SL features a front headlight, rear tail light, chain guard, and mounting points for front and rear baskets — ideal for carrying daily essentials. Certified by TüV, it meets strict European safety and quality standards, ensuring a secure and reliable ride every day.",
